Captions in list items do not create a paragraph gap

```
- | a |
  ^ cap
- c
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <caption>cap</caption>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </li>
  <li>c</li>
</ul>
```

